      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Electrical stimulation of medial parabrachial nucleus, nucleus cuneiformis, Raphe median nucleus and Raphe magnus nucleus induced cataleptic behaviour and analgesic effect in rats. Microinjections of 5,6-dihydroxytriptamine in n. Raphe magnus blocked the antinociception elicited by stimulation of these sites but did not affect the inhibition of locomotion."},
